WEBVTT

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.830
And she asked us
to support her through this.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:05.730
We were devastated
and none of us knew what to say.

00:05:06.697 --> 00:05:08.063
So she spoke first.

00:05:12.763 --> 00:05:15.963
"I want a private ceremony at home,
immediate family only.

00:05:16.563 --> 00:05:20.163
This is the outfit that I want to wear
and don't spend any money on flowers,

00:05:20.197 --> 00:05:22.530
but if you do, I like yellow ones."

00:05:22.563 --> 00:05:23.930
(Laughter)

00:05:23.963 --> 00:05:26.030
"I want my ashes scattered
on Mount Rainier,

00:05:26.063 --> 00:05:29.297
and afterwards for you all
to have a dinner party,

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.297
you know, nothing fancy, casual,